   "vid": "Gerald",
   "refused": false,
   "want": "seek_comfort"
  }
 ],
 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"They'd tell me to keep working. So I'm working. That's the whole plan.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "Carlos has an edge today — something curdled."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"...Anyway. Sorry. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Jae owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Jae said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"Why do you ask? Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "\"I've got things to do. People to avoid. You know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 19,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about grief — we wandered off it, 7 days back. '...Anyway. Sorry. What's on your mind?' We still owe what's been happening a proper ending, too.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"Heh. Nobody's asked me that in a while. ...I'm alright. Getting there.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I got lost in it for a second. What did you want to ask?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"The Alibi Chain. They just... took you. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"I do the small things right. The big things notice.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"As I said — Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"Okay, that's my quota of socializing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 26,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"I don't know what to do with my hands today. ...if that makes sense.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "Gerald shows you where they go to think. \"Don't tell the others. Everyone needs one place.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "They shake their head, then nod — both true at once. \"Talk to me a bit. That helps more than anything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"We lost Marcus and Jovan this week. I keep setting out extra portions. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Hm. Never mind — go on.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 33,
   "text": "\"...Actually, forget it.\""
  }
 ],
